/Title (Collaborative Disaster Management requires coordinated efforts from multiple stakeholders. Government agencies at central, state, and district levels lead policy formulation, resource allocation, and emergency response coordination. The private sector contributes through Corporate Social Responsibility initiatives, infrastructure support, and technological solutions. Media plays a crucial role in early warning dissemination and public awareness campaigns.)
